    "The Claude routed pairs have one task (ArcadeDB-4281) and Claude Sonnet 5, not Sonnet 5.5. Halv uses them per family.",
    "The bench prices sessions at base rates. Per-request long-context rates are not in the bench data.",
    "Cells match by model family and role. A pair without a cell uses the floor."
  ],
